{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/extras/c8c70933a3ba1b14bf7719b01be33c8a.avif?t=1765726944\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/extras_big/c8c70933a3ba1b14bf7719b01be33c8a.avif?t=1765726944 width=1560 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battery deck, poop deck, large chamber, fully explore a royal frigate from the bilge to the topgallant! Relive as never the immensity of these lost giants of the seas, surrounded by hundreds of sailors at the maneuver!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/extras/d715f9e54cd246516ce160fb19a0b510.avif?t=1765726944\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/extras_big/d715f9e54cd246516ce160fb19a0b510.avif?t=1765726944 width=1560 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a historical reconstruction of the Belle Poule frigate. Alongside archaeologists and historians, have a unique glimpse of the most accurate virtual ship reconstuction to date.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/extras/ea1cf804a53b92ad4081ffdf6f129d84.avif?t=1765726944\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/extras_big/ea1cf804a53b92ad4081ffdf6f129d84.avif?t=1765726944 width=1560 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the true navigation techniques of the time. Handle ropes, sails and navigation instruments like a true king's sailor. Use the wind and the currents to lead your ship to victory !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/extras/765ed15d005fc813560e335293082cca.avif?t=1765726944\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/extras_big/765ed15d005fc813560e335293082cca.avif?t=1765726944 width=1560 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master 18th century naval artillery. Load, aim and fire the cannons. Experience the agitation and crash of broadsides from the gun deck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/extras/816e12b98a43e5fd1f71b7948289627f.avif?t=1765726944\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/extras_big/816e12b98a43e5fd1f71b7948289627f.avif?t=1765726944 width=1560 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share meals and life moments with the crew, traditions and living conditions of sailors. Experience a total and unique immersion in the daily life of 18th century sailors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/extras/43048396e797cd3375fdc8c953ef0d56.avif?t=1765726944\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/extras_big/43048396e797cd3375fdc8c953ef0d56.avif?t=1765726944 width=1560 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your place among the crew! Officers, boatswains, soldiers, sailors. Interact with the crowd of sailors, discover the hierarchies and explore the different roles available to you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4002690?t=1765726944","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/7874787505a507dc524defb17e2441f7b407ba14/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765726944","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/89729c08697455ac4017d7df93c0c3f0ecb63bce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765726944","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/89729c08697455ac4017d7df93c0c3f0ecb63bce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765726944","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game may include content that is not appropriate for all ages or for consultation at work: Occasional violence"},"demos":[{"appid":4212620,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/extras/c8c70933a3ba1b14bf7719b01be33c8a.avif?t=1765726944\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/extras_big/c8c70933a3ba1b14bf7719b01be33c8a.avif?t=1765726944 width=1560 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battery deck, poop deck, large chamber, fully explore a royal frigate from the bilge to the topgallant! Relive as never the immensity of these lost giants of the seas, surrounded by hundreds of sailors at the maneuver!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/extras/d715f9e54cd246516ce160fb19a0b510.avif?t=1765726944\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/extras_big/d715f9e54cd246516ce160fb19a0b510.avif?t=1765726944 width=1560 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a historical reconstruction of the Belle Poule frigate. Alongside archaeologists and historians, have a unique glimpse of the most accurate virtual ship reconstuction to date.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/extras/ea1cf804a53b92ad4081ffdf6f129d84.avif?t=1765726944\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/extras_big/ea1cf804a53b92ad4081ffdf6f129d84.avif?t=1765726944 width=1560 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the true navigation techniques of the time. Handle ropes, sails and navigation instruments like a true king's sailor. Use the wind and the currents to lead your ship to victory !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/extras/765ed15d005fc813560e335293082cca.avif?t=1765726944\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/extras_big/765ed15d005fc813560e335293082cca.avif?t=1765726944 width=1560 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master 18th century naval artillery. Load, aim and fire the cannons. Experience the agitation and crash of broadsides from the gun deck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/extras/816e12b98a43e5fd1f71b7948289627f.avif?t=1765726944\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/extras_big/816e12b98a43e5fd1f71b7948289627f.avif?t=1765726944 width=1560 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share meals and life moments with the crew, traditions and living conditions of sailors. Experience a total and unique immersion in the daily life of 18th century sailors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/extras/43048396e797cd3375fdc8c953ef0d56.avif?t=1765726944\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/extras_big/43048396e797cd3375fdc8c953ef0d56.avif?t=1765726944 width=1560 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your place among the crew! Officers, boatswains, soldiers, sailors. Interact with the crowd of sailors, discover the hierarchies and explore the different roles available to you!</p>","developers":["BLACK COG Visual Effects"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002690/782cc85634704d35ca5f7c1eed25192f3fdf521b/header.jpg?t=1765726944","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4002690/42872192/ef2cf7b7e3bfad6b3831eabfa555302b85fc265a/1757344005/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758306505","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4002690/42872192/ef2cf7b7e3bfad6b3831eabfa555302b85fc265a/1757344005/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758306505","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4002690/42872192/ef2cf7b7e3bfad6b3831eabfa555302b85fc265a/1757344005/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758306505","id":257194577,"name":"La Royale : Below Deck Teaser 1","thumbnail":"htt